Hello <%= @booking.client.name.presence || 'there' %>,

This is a reminder that payment is still due for your class booking:

Class: <%= @booking.class_session.class_template.title %>
When: <%= @booking.class_session.start_time.strftime('%B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p') %>
<% if (duration = @booking.class_session.class_template.duration_minutes) %>
Duration: <%= duration %> minutes
<% end %>
<% if (instructor = @booking.class_session.instructor) %>
Instructor: <%= instructor.name %>
<% end %>
<% if (location_name = @booking.class_session.class_template.studio_location&.name) %>
Location: <%= location_name %>
<% end %>
<% if (room = @booking.class_session.room).present? %>
Room: <%= room %>
<% end %>
<% if @booking.price_cents.to_i > 0 %>
Amount due: <%= number_to_currency(@booking.price_cents / 100.0) %>
<% end %>

Pay now with secure checkout:
<%= @checkout_url %>

Or view your booking in the app:
<%= @booking_url %>

If you already paid, you can ignore this email.
